   "message": "wp433: secrets-set kiem kieu bundle va token (SECRETS-SET-BUNDLE-KIEU r5)\n\n- M1: bundle giai ma khong phai object => rc 3, mot dong stderr, ngay sau\n  giai ma va truoc moi co/export/canary/upload.\n- M2: token khong phai str (khi thieu TL_TOKEN) => coi nhu thieu, roi vao\n  nhanh canh bao san co, khong lay repr lam khoa public.\n- M3: fragment wp433_secrets_set_bundle viet lai theo quy tac ve r5:\n  danh muc khoa dong 346 khoa ca.luot.quan_sat, ky vong chep cung,\n  ban do {khoa: bool} ghi ra $WP433_SS_BAN_DO; ma tran dot bien N4 chay o\n  rig ngoai fragment, moi dot bien mot tien trinh moi.\n- M4: tai sinh bundled bang write_bundled_modules.\n\nLease wp433-r10-g1-claude, issue #433.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015Gtxrc7bYsQV8yrj7rsD1S",
